==Output==
The output is in the btxml format that the mikropad accepts. That means
that all whitspaces are already replaced with a <sp> tag. The invokation
of the G1 Character set is not done here. You will need to do that manualy.

<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>`pp`pp<sp><sp><sp><sp>pp0<apd><apr>
<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>px|_______j__u<sp><sp>z__5<apd><apr>
<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>______?//'"___4h___%<apd><apr>
<sp><sp>`x|~__}<sp>//'!__5<sp><sp><sp><sp>j______%<sp><apd><apr>
`~_______u<sp><sp><sp><sp>___<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>k____'<sp><sp><apd><apr>
___?'!"___4<sp><sp><sp>k__<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>"___?<sp><sp><sp><apd><apr>
___0<sp><sp><sp>z__5<sp><sp><sp>j__<sp><sp><sp><sp><sp>h___}<sp><sp><sp><apd><apr>
k__}<sp><sp>____5<sp><sp><sp>j__4<sp><sp><sp>`_____5<sp><sp><apd><apr>
<sp>o__4<sp>____t<sp><sp><sp>*__5<sp><sp><sp>z__?___<sp><sp><apd><apr>
